# Where the post-deploy suite points for the prod environment. Committed
# rather than held as GitHub Environment variables so a hostname change is a
# reviewable diff, matching mindshub_inference/tests/integration/envs.
#
# cowork-server is reached over its public host, because the ingress is what
# authenticates the dedicated standing Bearer key. Prod does not call auth's
# mutating test-user provisioner until ENG-1420 makes that path safe.
COWORK_BASE_URL=https://cowork.mindshub.ai
